<p class="eyebrow" data-copy-en="Character guide" data-copy-zh="角色攻略">Character guide</p>
<h1 data-copy-en="Kalb" data-copy-zh="Kalb">Kalb</h1>
<p class="starter-description" data-copy-en="Use Kalb’s food orders, Cooking reward, community scenes, guild errands and one-time promotion." data-copy-zh="了解Kalb的点餐、烹饪奖励、社区事件、公会差事与一次性宣传。">Use Kalb’s food orders, Cooking reward, community scenes, guild errands and one-time promotion.</p>
<div class="wiki-source-line"><span data-copy-en="v1.0_BETAx · Updated 9 November 2026" data-copy-zh="v1.0_BETAx · 2026 年 11 月 9 日更新">v1.0_BETAx · Updated 9 November 2026</span></div></div></section>
<section class="section wiki-reading-section"><div class="container wiki-reading-layout">
<aside class="wiki-toc"><div class="wiki-toc-inner"><button aria-expanded="false" class="wiki-toc-toggle" data-wiki-toc-toggle="" type="button"><span data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</span><span aria-hidden="true">+</span></button><p class="wiki-toc-heading" data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</p><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="en" data-wiki-toc-links=""><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-overview">Overview</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-location">Where to find them</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-route">Route and relationship milestones</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-activities">Activities and rewards</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-troubleshooting">What usually blocks the next step</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-related">Related guides</a></div><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="zh" data-wiki-toc-links="" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-overview">概览</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-location">去哪里找</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-route">路线与关系进展</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-activities">行动与奖励</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-troubleshooting">卡住时检查什么</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-related">相关指南</a></div></div></aside>
<article class="wiki-article"><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-en" data-lang-panel="en" lang="en"><section id="en-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Optional_Private-Client_Bookings"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Ask_Kalb_to_Spread_the_Word"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Caravan_Under_Attack"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Community_Encounters"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Cooking_Tips"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Talk_and_Food_Purchases"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Recommended_Walkthrough"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Quick_Stats"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Overview"></span><h2>Overview</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="View full screenshot: Kalb — character portrait." href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/kalb.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Kalb — character portrait." decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/kalb.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>Kalb — character portrait.</figcaption></figure><p>Kalb’s food stall offers ordinary conversation, three meals that build affection, a Cooking reward and several connected errands. The food orders, guild route and business promotion have separate requirements.</p></section>
<section id="en-location"><h2>Where to find them</h2><p>Find him at Food Vendors, daily 06:00–21:00 in the Grand Bazaar.</p></section>
<section id="en-route"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Thieves_Guild_Quest_Chain"></span><h2>Route and relationship milestones</h2><p>Start with Talk or meals. Cooking Tips is available from Stranger 0:$80/30 min,3 Cooking and 5 direct affection once. The Thieves Guild branch begins after Shadow's Rules:visit Kalb, then Caravan Rest Stop20:00–24:00, then return to Kalb.</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Automatic scene</th><th scope="col">Location / start window</th><th scope="col">Requirements</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">The Mystery of Missing Herbs</th><td data-label="Location / start window">General Goods Store; 18:00–20:59</td><td data-label="Requirements">Hailey Known (25); Acknowledged (10); Ben Arthur Acknowledged (10)</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Recipe Exchange</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Food Vendors; 08:00–16:59</td><td data-label="Requirements">Acknowledged (10); Wilfred Acknowledged (10); Honey Acknowledged (10); home from vacation: Honey</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Kind Fox</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Food Vendors; 06:00–20:59</td><td data-label="Requirements">Acknowledged (10); Sophie Stranger (0); home from vacation: Sophie</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Caravan Under Attack</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Caravan Rest Stop</td><td data-label="Requirements"></td></tr><tr><th scope="row">What the Foxes Say</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Forest Hut</td><td data-label="Requirements">Theneas Friend (100); Friend (100); Foxy Friend (100)</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Fox's Ears</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Food Vendors</td><td data-label="Requirements">after Shadow's Rules</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Clearing the Road</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Caravan Rest Stop; 20:00–23:59</td><td data-label="Requirements">after The Fox's Ears</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Good News Travels Fast</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Food Vendors</td><td data-label="Requirements">after Clearing the Road</td></tr></tbody></table><p>The guild chain is The Fox's Ears → Clearing the Road → Good News Travels Fast. It does not require his optional community scenes or promotion.</p><p>Other scenes include the herbs mystery at Hailey’s store 18:00–21:00 (Hailey Known 25, Kalb and Ben Arthur Acknowledged 10); recipe exchange at the stall 08:00–17:00 (Kalb, Wilfred and Honey Acknowledged 10, Honey home); Sophie’s stall visit after Kalb Acknowledged 10 with Sophie home; and the forest-hut meeting when Kalb, Theneas and Foxy are all Friend 100.</p></section>
<section id="en-activities"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Performance_Stage_Reaction"></span><h2>Activities and rewards</h2><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Action</th><th scope="col">Requirements / start window</th><th scope="col">Cost / recovery</th><th scope="col">Reward / limit</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Talk to Kalb</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Food Vendors; Stranger (0)</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">10 min</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">+1 base affection; 6/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Cooking Tips</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Food Vendors; Stranger (0)</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">30 min; $80</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">+5 direct affection; Cooking +3; once</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Food orders take 15 min and each give 1 base Kalb affection, without using Talk’s allowance: fresh vegetables $10 restore 15 Satiation/10 Energy; cooked meats $18 restore 20 Satiation/15 Health; pie $15 restores 18 Satiation/10 Calm.</p><p>Ask Kalb to Spread the Word requires Friend 100 and active Sophie staff,06:00–21:00:$500/0 min, once,1 promotion level. The performance-stage reaction and initial caravan encounter are separate from his guild errands.</p><p>From business Reputation level 3, Kalb can be selected by the separate Receive a Client system at the Rose &amp; Thorn entrance, brothel branch/Netorare enabled. The eligible-client roll is random and uses the shared daily booking allowance.</p><p>Favorite stats are Charm, Cooking, Perception. Learning Creative Cooking improves the relationship bonus.</p><p>Start times are shown; the ending hour is excluded. Base affection receives the relationship bonuses, while direct affection is added as listed. Ordinary affection, player Erotic Experience and NPC intimacy experience are separate.</p></section>
<section id="en-troubleshooting"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Troubleshooting"></span><h2>What usually blocks the next step</h2><ul><li>Talk actually gives 1 base affection in 10 min, six/day; food orders have their own rewards.</li><li>The caravan guild step starts 20:00–24:00 after Kalb’s introduction, not during the food stall’s daytime visit.</li><li>Promotion requires Sophie active as staff; merely meeting her does not satisfy it.</li></ul></section>
<section id="en-related"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Related_Pages"></span><h2>Related guides</h2><ul><li><a href="game-systems-thieves-guild.html">Thieves Guild errands</a></li><li><a href="character-hailey.html">Hailey</a></li><li><a href="character-wilfred.html">Wilfred</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-brothel.html">Promotion and client bookings</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-bards-guild.html">Performance-stage reactions</a></li></ul></section>
</div><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-zh" data-lang-panel="zh" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><section id="zh-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Optional_Private-Client_Bookings"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Ask_Kalb_to_Spread_the_Word"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Caravan_Under_Attack"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Community_Encounters"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Cooking_Tips"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Talk_and_Food_Purchases"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Recommended_Walkthrough"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Quick_Stats"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Overview"></span><h2>概览</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="查看完整截图：Kalb 的角色头像。" href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/kalb.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Kalb 的角色头像。" decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/kalb.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>Kalb 的角色头像。</figcaption></figure><p>Kalb的摊位提供普通交谈、三种可增加好感的餐点、烹饪奖励及相连差事。点餐、公会路线与青楼宣传各有独立条件。</p></section>
<section id="zh-location"><h2>去哪里找</h2><p>每天06:00–21:00位于大集市的食物摊贩。</p></section>
<section id="zh-route"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Thieves_Guild_Quest_Chain"></span><h2>路线与关系进展</h2><p>可先交谈或点餐。陌生人0即可进行烹饪技巧，$80、30分钟，一次性增加3烹饪与5直接好感。盗贼公会分支在Shadow的规矩后开始：先找Kalb，再于20:00–24:00前往商队休息站，之后回报Kalb。</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">自动事件</th><th scope="col">地点／开始时段</th><th scope="col">条件</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">失踪草药之谜</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">杂货店；18:00–20:59</td><td data-label="条件">Hailey 已知（25好感）；已遇见（10好感）；Ben Arthur 已遇见（10好感）</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">食谱交换</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">食物摊贩；08:00–16:59</td><td data-label="条件">已遇见（10好感）；Wilfred 已遇见（10好感）；Honey 已遇见（10好感）；已结束度假：Honey</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">善良的狐狸</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">食物摊贩；06:00–20:59</td><td data-label="条件">已遇见（10好感）；Sophie 陌生人（0好感）；已结束度假：Sophie</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">遭袭的商队</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">商队休息站</td><td data-label="条件"></td></tr><tr><th scope="row">狐狸们怎么叫</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">森林小屋</td><td data-label="条件">Theneas 朋友（100好感）；朋友（100好感）；Foxy 朋友（100好感）</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">狐狸的耳朵</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">食物摊贩</td><td data-label="条件">完成：Shadow的规矩</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">清理道路</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">商队休息站；20:00–23:59</td><td data-label="条件">完成：狐狸的耳朵</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">好消息传得快</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">食物摊贩</td><td data-label="条件">完成：清理道路</td></tr></tbody></table><p>公会链为狐狸的耳朵→清理道路→好消息传得快，不要求先完成可选社区事件或宣传。</p><p>其他事件包括：Hailey商店18:00–21:00的药草谜案，要求Hailey已知25、Kalb及Ben Arthur已遇见10；摊位08:00–17:00的食谱交流，要求Kalb、Wilfred、Honey均已遇见10且Honey未度假；Kalb已遇见10、Sophie未度假时的摊位来访；以及Kalb、Theneas、Foxy均为朋友100时的森林小屋会面。</p></section>
<section id="zh-activities"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Performance_Stage_Reaction"></span><h2>行动与奖励</h2><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">行动</th><th scope="col">条件／开始时段</th><th scope="col">消耗／恢复</th><th scope="col">奖励／次数</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">和 Kalb 交谈</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">食物摊贩；陌生人（0好感）</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">10分钟</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">基础好感+1；每天6次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">烹饪技巧</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">食物摊贩；陌生人（0好感）</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">30分钟；$80</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">直接好感+5；烹饪+3；仅一次</td></tr></tbody></table><p>餐点均为15分钟、1基础好感，不占交谈额度：新鲜蔬菜$10，恢复15饱腹感、10精力；熟肉$18，恢复20饱腹感、15生命；派$15，恢复18饱腹感、10镇定。</p><p>请Kalb帮忙宣传要求朋友100、Sophie在职，06:00–21:00可用，$500、0分钟，仅一次，宣传等级+1。演出台反应与首次商队事件和公会差事分开。</p><p>青楼声誉等级3起，经营青楼分支并开启Netorare时，Kalb可被玫瑰与荆棘入口独立的接待客人系统抽中；客人随机选择，共用每天一次预约额度。</p><p>偏好的属性为魅力、烹饪、感知。学会创意烹饪可提高关系加成。</p><p>表中均为开始时间，不包含结束整点。基础好感受关系加成影响，直接好感按所列数值增加。普通好感、玩家情趣经验和NPC亲密经验分别计算。</p></section>
<section id="zh-troubleshooting"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Troubleshooting"></span><h2>卡住时检查什么</h2><ul><li>交谈实际为10分钟、1基础好感，每天六次；点餐另有奖励。</li><li>商队公会环节在Kalb介绍后20:00–24:00开始，不是白天摊位行程。</li><li>宣传要求Sophie在职，仅见过她还不够。</li></ul></section>
<section id="zh-related"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Related_Pages"></span><h2>相关指南</h2><ul><li><a href="game-systems-thieves-guild.html">盗贼公会差事</a></li><li><a href="character-hailey.html">Hailey</a></li><li><a href="character-wilfred.html">Wilfred</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-brothel.html">宣传与客人预约</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-bards-guild.html">演出台反应</a></li></ul></section>
